  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">얼마전 최효석 선생님이 올려주신 9볼트 전지로 철솜을 산화시키고 질량을 측정하는 실험을 보고<br>어차피 물의 전기분해를 위해 9볼트 전지를 샀으니<br><br>&#39;금속&#39;으로 전기를 흐르게 하여 &#39;합성&#39;실험(철의 연소)을 하고 &#39;질량&#39; 탐구하기<br><br>&#39;전해질&#39;로 전기를 흐르게 하여 &#39;분해&#39;실험(물의 분해)을 하고 &#39;부피&#39; 탐구하기<br><br>이렇게 연결지어 해보기로 마음먹었습니다. ㅎㅎ<br>물론 시간이 모자랄것 같긴 한데.. 일단 계획은 너무 마음에 들어서 공유합니다^^<br></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/111e5c789c88842fb8fb997a291fba99494a02e9\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/111e5c789c88842fb8fb997a291fba99494a02e9\" data-origin-width=\"1024\" data-origin-height=\"572\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3cf4a72e674180bb30ea75b9d4759d586bcd7f43\" data-file-name=\"9V_Battery_Science.pdf\" data-file-size=\"16404214\" data-mimetype=\"application/pdf\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHq%26dataid%3D1277%26fileid%3D2%26regdt%3D20260330224210&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F3cf4a72e674180bb30ea75b9d4759d586bcd7f43')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">9V_Battery_Science</span><span class=\"type\">.pdf</span></div><div class=\"size\">15.64MB</div></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e5b0b02d0ab7c254810f7106753815175d3c8794\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e5b0b02d0ab7c254810f7106753815175d3c8794\" data-origin-width=\"1073\" data-origin-height=\"8618\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
